[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2433283950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98358#issuecomment-2433283950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98358","id":2433283950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RCPdu","user":{"login":"htmiel","id":45831521,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODMxNTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45831521?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel","html_url":"https://github.com/htmiel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-23T19:39:31Z","updated_at":"2024-10-23T19:39:31Z","body":"I just noticed that the issue happens actually on any kind of client disconnect, by calling on the client side any of the disconnect methods:\r\n```\r\npeer.peer_disconnect()\r\npeer.peer_disconnect_later()\r\npeer.peer_disconnect_now()\r\n```\r\nThe memory used by the server is not freed until the client app gracefully closes.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2433283950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2488892304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98358#issuecomment-2488892304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98358","id":2488892304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UWXuQ","user":{"login":"htmiel","id":45831521,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODMxNTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45831521?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel","html_url":"https://github.com/htmiel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/htmiel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-20T15:28:45Z","updated_at":"2024-11-20T15:28:45Z","body":"Alternatively, would it be possible to have the option to manually free the memory used by an ENetPacketPeer? (since I do receive the disconnect event when servicing the connection)\n\nI noticed the `ENetPacketPeer` has a `reset()` method, and I tried to call it when a peer disconnects, to hopefully clear the memory, but I get the error: `Peer not connected`.\n\nAs the `ENetPacketPeer` is based on `RefCounted`, I also tied to call the `unreference()` method when the peer disconnects, but it had no effect.\n\nIn case I am doing something wrong in using ENetConnection/ENetPacketPeer, I would much appreciate any guidance.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2488892304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263697384","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98358#issuecomment-3263697384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98358","id":3263697384,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CiBHo","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-07T11:09:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-07T11:09:26Z","body":"Can replicate on `v4.5.rc1` on both Linux and Windows 11.\n\nOn Linux, there appears to be a memory leak sometimes even on the normal scenario, as the memory baseline steadily increases. Nevertheless, a bulk of memory is properly freed if clients disconnect gracefully, but not if the process is killed:\n|Quit | Kill |\n|-|-|\n|<img width=\"1218\" height=\"260\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe9114b5-8e08-4cf4-b7f5-412a90bf01f1\" />|<img width=\"1217\" height=\"245\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ee38c41-98fa-4ea4-92f9-073f425f28d1\" />|\n\nOn Windows 11, memory is properly freed with normal quitting, but the memory leak when killing the client's process is still present:\n|Quit | Kill |\n|-|-|\n|<img width=\"1007\" height=\"257\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6bd6b059-d817-402e-b93c-d0fb04887adb\" />|<img width=\"1005\" height=\"255\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d3ca3b4-e2d8-4f38-bac2-6de4741435c1\" />|","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263697384/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733276904","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98358#issuecomment-3733276904","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98358","id":3733276904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ehUjo","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T17:42:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T17:42:39Z","body":"The root cause of the leak is specific to the custom ENet-DTLS implementation, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114834 for details.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733276904/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]